"""librosa >= 0.10 lazy-loads through .pyi stub files that Vercel's Python
bundler strips from vendored packages, so importing librosa crashes with
"Cannot load imports from non-existent stub". This module embeds the stubs
and patches lazy_loader.attach_stub to read them from /tmp when the
originals are missing. Regenerate with tests/fixtures? No - regenerate by
rerunning the generator in the PR description whenever librosa is bumped.
"""

